        "@value": "REMARK: The details of this class can be provided by using the <a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/owl-time/\">Time Ontology</a> according to the type of Duration. Eg if the type is DPV:TemporalDuration one could adda OWL-TIME:TemporalEntity as an additional type and hasXSDDuration as an attribute."
