        "@value": "Refers to the type of the Technical Organisational Measure that has been taken to protect the the PersonalData. Examples of TechnicalMeasures are Anonymisation, Encryption, WebSecurityProtocols. OrganisationalMeasures could be measures like ConsentNotices, Privacy Notices, CredentialManagement."
      }
    ],
